      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "1. If you just started with VRChat: then wait first for a while until you get message you may upload avatars and worlds. This is standard rule and setup. So spend first some hours in VRChat. \nThis is not a bug.\n2. You cannot upload with Steam account. You need VRChat account (in vrchat.com site). Play VRChat for a while until you get permission to upload avatars.\nYou can merge Steam account with VRChat account.\nIf you think it's taking too long time, dont post here, but send ticket to VRChat support. Most people are fine and it's not a general bug.\nPerhaps until your nametag turn blue or green, it's not possible to do it. Just have patience. It can takes some days.",
